      "alertTitle": "Train service between Tung Chung and Sunny Bay ends earlier today",
      "alertTitleTc": "東涌綫來往東涌及欣澳列車服務提早完結",
      "alertContent": "<div class=\"alert-content min-text\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<p id=\"message-content\"></p>\n<p class=\"_blank_\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">To facilitate the Tung Chung Line Extension work, Tung Chung Line train service between Tung Chung and Sunny Bay ends earlier today (28 Nov). The last trains to and from Tung Chung departed at:</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 42px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 49.9293%;\"><col style=\"width: 49.9293%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\">\n<td>From Tung Chung to Hong Kong</td>\n<td>23:02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\">\n<td>From Hong Kong to Tung Chung</td>\n<td>23:07</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table id=\"alert-table-en\" class=\"alert-table body-text\"></table>\n<p class=\"_blank_\" style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"_blank_\" style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\">Train service between Hong Kong and Sunny Bay, as well as the Airport Express, remains normal.</p>\n<p class=\"_blank_\" style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"_blank_\" style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\">Free MTR shuttle buses are provided between Tung Chung and Sunny Bay stations. The estimated journey time is 20-30 minutes, with a frequency of 3-9 minutes. Please allow sufficient time for your journey.</p>\n<p class=\"_blank_\" style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.8535%; height: 62.6042px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 49.8688%;\"><col style=\"width: 49.8688%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 20.8681px;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">Departure time of the last bus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 20.8681px;\">\n<td>From Tung Chung</td>\n<td>00:43*&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 20.8681px;\">\n<td>From Sunny Bay</td>\n<td>01:18&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"_blank_\" style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\">*To take the train from Sunny Bay towards Hong Kong, please take the shuttle bus before 00:18. If you are taking the last train on other lines, please allow extra time.</p>\n<ul id=\"li-beneath-alert-table\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"></ul>\n<ul id=\"iTCI-arrangement\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"></ul>\n<ul id=\"alternative-transport\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"></ul>\n<ul id=\"alter-transport\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"></ul>\n<ul id=\"shuttle-bus\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"></ul>\n<ul id=\"alert-remarks\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"></ul>\n<ul id=\"closing1\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"></ul>\n</div>",
      "alertContentTc": "<div class=\"alert-content min-text\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<p id=\"message-content\"></p>\n<p class=\"_blank_\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">配合東涌綫延綫工程，今晚(11月28日)東涌綫來往東涌及欣澳的列車服務提早完結。最後一班列車已於以下時間開出：</p>\n<table id=\"alert-table-ch\" class=\"alert-table body-text\"></table>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.8535%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>由東涌往香港站</td>\n<td>23:02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>由香港站往東涌</td>\n<td>23:07</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"_blank_\" style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"_blank_\" style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\">香港站至欣澳及機場快綫服務正常。</p>\n<p class=\"_blank_\" style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"_blank_\" style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\">我們提供港鐵免費接駁巴士來往東涌及欣澳，預計車程為 20 &ndash; 30 分鐘，班次為 3 &ndash; 9 分鐘一班，請預留充足時間乘車。</p>\n<p class=\"_blank_\" style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 69px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">最後一班巴士開出時間&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\">\n<td>東涌開出</td>\n<td>00:43*&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\">\n<td>欣澳開出</td>\n<td>01:18&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"_blank_\" style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\">*如需乘搭由欣澳開往香港站方向的列車，請乘搭00:18前開出的接駁巴士。乘搭其他綫的尾班車，請預留額外時間。</p>\n<ul id=\"li-beneath-alert-table\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"></ul>\n<ul id=\"iTCI-arrangement\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"></ul>\n<ul id=\"alternative-transport\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"></ul>\n<ul id=\"alter-transport\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"></ul>\n<ul id=\"shuttle-bus\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"></ul>\n<ul id=\"alert-remarks\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"></ul>\n<ul id=\"closing1\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"></ul>\n</div>",
